e_name": "Image Sequence_018_0000.png", "id": "3888313721408067", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499327047_3888313724741400_8433662412092859559_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=vIfwXP3E09sQ7kNvwG4U_c5&_nc_oc=Adm5eJtnIoNM2iDSMi_m7vbV8GNd4utIk3aaxhNnn7gHa1abjL-xRuKl39yibprc0So&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfwPoFRKIlg1HEoYkxXI7Pf1iP_9xPAwxNIWhZBHXV9smw&oe=69B15FC6"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "SMSCP Skilldrive Training Sim", "keywords": ["engineering", "education", "mechatronics", "simulations", "training"], "long_description": "SMSCP Skilldrive is a VR-based educational training platform developed by the Virtual Mechatronics Lab to simulate key modules of the Siemens Mechatronic Systems Certification Program (SMSCP).\n\nThis experience introduces users to mechatronic systems through:\n\nSensors Scene: Learn about different types of sensors by virtually connecting and testing them in real-time.\n\nGears Scene: Explore various gear types, their operation, and real-world applications.\n\nEach module includes:\n\nEducational panels with step-by-step instructions\n\nSummarized theory content on the topic\n\nAn interactive quiz/test to assess learning outcomes\n\nDesigned to support skill development in TVET and engineering institutions, SMSCP Skilldrive enhances hands-on learning through immersive simulation aligned with global mechatronics training standards.", "short_description": "An immersive VR training platform that introduces users to Siemens SMSCP concepts through interactive sensor and gear simulations."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://vml.dkut.ac.ke/docs/censent%20vr.pdf", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Siemens Mechatronic Systems Certification Centre (DeKUT)", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://vml.dkut.ac.ke/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABL